*** Keywords ***
General_SiSo_Auto_Antenna_Online_Monitoring
    [Documentation]
    ...  Verifies Antenna Online Monitoring using selenium, during L3call data transfer on NR/LTE cell
    ...  and with additional reset or block:
    ...     1) RMOD reset
    ...     2) Cell block/unblock
    ...     3) RAT reset (argument cell_type states which RAT will be reset)
    ...     4) BBMODs reset
    ...     User has to choose which method from above will be used - RMOD reset as default option.
    ...     (reset_rmod, block_cells, reset_rat, reset_bbmods).
    ...     As an additional check keyword will verify if start and stop antenna online monitoring test for admin cli
    ...     methods are working properly (check_admin_cli).
    ...
    ...    ARGS:
    ...      - rmod_id (int): configuration RMOD ID to perform antenna online monitoring, e.g.: 1
    ...      - cell_id (int): global cell id of NR/LTE cell to perform antenna online monitoring, e.g.: 1
    ...      - antenna_list (list(str) or str): list of antenna ids to perform antenna online monitoring, e.g.: ['ANT1', 'ANT2'], ['PHYANT'] or 'PHYANT'
    ...      - throughputs (dict): dict with throughput and deviation values for each cell identified by nrCellIdentity for NR cells.
    ...        Example:
    ...                 {'827736065': {'throughput': {'downlink': '100 Mbits/sec',
    ...                                               'uplink': '15 Mbits/sec'},
    ...                                'deviation': '90%'},
    ...                  }
    ...      - cell_type (str): type of cell; defaults to 'nr'.
    ...      - reset_action (str): indicates what reset action will be performed ; defaults to reset_rmod.
    ...                            available options: 'reset_rmod', 'block_cells', 'reset_rat', 'reset_bbmods'
    ...      - monitoring_duration (int): duration (in seconds) of antenna online monitoring during L3call data transfer, defaults to 60
    ...      - protocol (str): data transfer protocol; defaults to 'udp'.
    ...      - udp_buffer (str): monitoring data buffer; defaults to '4M'.
    ...      - timeout (int): timeout (in seconds) for selenium operations like start_antenna_line_monitoring etc., defaults to 60
    ...      - check_admin_cli (bool): if True - antenna online monitoring test with admin CLI check ; defaults to True
    ...      - required_measurements (list of str) - list of required measurement to check ; defaults to ['VSWR', 'RTWP', 'RSSI', 'ETP']

    [Arguments]                                             ${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     ${cell_id}
    ...                                                     ${antenna_list}
    ...                                                     ${throughputs}
    ...                                                     ${cell_type}=nr
    ...                                                     ${reset_action}=reset_rmod
    ...                                                     ${monitoring_duration}=60
    ...                                                     ${protocol}=udp
    ...                                                     ${udp_buffer}=4M
    ...                                                     ${timeout}=60
    ...                                                     ${check_admin_cli}=${True}
    ...                                                     ${required_measurements}=${default_required_measurements}
    [Timeout]                                               24 hours

    Robot Log Operation                                     Creating path for csv files...
    ${csv_directory}                                        Set variable    ${logs_path}/csv_files
    logs.create_dir_if_doesnt_exist                         dir_path=${csv_directory}

    ${bts_type}                                             hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}                                           connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    Create admin session with default alias                 bts_type=${bts_type}
    ${webui_obj}                                            Create Selenium Session
    ...                                                     admin_connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     download_dir=${csv_directory}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    ${runtime_rmod_id}                                      admin_info_model.translate_rmod_index_to_runtime
    ...                                                     rmod_index=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    ${rmod_name}                                            admin_info_model.get_product_name_for_rmod
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    ${antenna_list}                                         ant_online_monitoring.prepare_antenna_list
    ...                                                     antenna_list=${antenna_list}

    ${antenna_lines}                                        Create Dictionary
    ...                                                     RMOD-${rmod_id}/RMOD_R-${runtime_rmod_id}(${rmod_name})= ${antenna_list}

    ${cell_dist_names}                                      admin_info_model.get_dist_names_for_specific_cell
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     cell_type=${cell_type}
    ...                                                     cell_id=${cell_id}

    ${active_antennas}                                      admin_info_model.get_active_antennas_for_cell
    ...                                                     cell_dist_name=${cell_dist_names["configuration"]}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    Run Keyword If    ${check_admin_cli}                    Run Keywords
    ...                                                     Robot Log Operation
    ...                                                     Verifying start and stop antenna online monitoring via admin...
    ...                                                     AND
    ...                                                     Start CLI Antenna Online Monitoring
    ...                                                     target_dns=${active_antennas}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     AND
    ...                                                     Sleep
    ...                                                     30s
    ...                                                     AND
    ...                                                     Stop CLI Antenna Online Monitoring
    ...                                                     output_file_path=/tmp/antennaresults
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     AND
    ...                                                     Robot Log Result
    ...                                                     Start and stop validation for admin antenna online monitoring succeeded.
    ...                                                     console=${True}

    Robot Log Result                                        ${antenna_lines}
    ...                                                     console=${True}

    webui.select_antenna_lines_for_monitoring               antenna_lines=${antenna_lines}
    ...                                                     timeout=${timeout}

    ${l3_call_duration}                                     Evaluate
    ...                                                     ${monitoring_duration}*2

    Execute L3 Call In Background                           direction=DL
    ...                                                     duration=${l3_call_duration}s
    ...                                                     throughputs=${throughputs}
    ...                                                     protocol=${protocol}
    ...                                                     called_cell=${cell_dist_names["configuration"]}
    ...                                                     udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Starting webui antenna online monitoring...
    webui.start_antenna_line_monitoring                     timeout=${timeout}

    Sleep                                                   ${monitoring_duration}s
    ...                                                     Reason=Waiting ${monitoring_duration}s to collect measurements in antenna online monitoring.

    Robot Log Operation                                     Stopping antenna online monitoring...
    webui.stop_antenna_line_monitoring                      timeout=${timeout}

    ${monitored_values}                                     Get Monitored Values
    ${csv_file_path}                                        Get CSV File

    Verify CSV File content                                 path_to_csv_file=${csv_file_path}
    ...                                                     monitored_values_from_webui=${monitored_values}
    ...                                                     runtime_rmod_id=${runtime_rmod_id}
    vm.move_file_to_target_directory                        origin_file_path=${csv_file_path}
    ...                                                     target_file_path=${csv_directory}/ANTLMonitoring_monitored_values_before_reset

    Robot Log Operation                                     Verifying antenna online monitoring measurements..
    Verify Antenna Online Monitoring Measurements Presence
    ...                                                     monitored_values=${monitored_values}
    ...                                                     required_measurements=${required_measurements}
    ...                                                     antenna_list=${antenna_list}
    Verify Antenna Online Monitoring Measurements during L3Call
    ...                                                     monitored_values=${monitored_values}
    ...                                                     cell_dist_name=${cell_dist_names["configuration"]}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     antenna_list=${antenna_list}

    Wait For Background L3 Call Completion And Verify Results
    ...                                                     called_cell=${cell_dist_names["configuration"]}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Starting antenna online monitoring...
    webui.start_antenna_line_monitoring                     timeout=${timeout}

    Run Keyword If                                          "${reset_action}" == "reset_rmod"
    ...                                                     Reset RMOD and Check Antenna Online Monitoring Unavailability
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     csv_directory=${csv_directory}
    ...                                    ELSE IF          "${reset_action}" == "block_cells"
    ...                                                     Block/Unblock Cells and Antenna Online Monitoring Unavailability
    ...                                                     rmod_id=${rmod_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                                     csv_directory=${csv_directory}
    ...                                    ELSE IF          "${reset_action}" == "reset_rat"
    ...                                                     Reset Rat and Antenna Online Monitoring Unavailability
    ...                                                     rat_type=${cell_type}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                                     csv_directory=${csv_directory}
    ...                                    ELSE IF          "${reset_action}" == "reset_bbmods"
    ...                                                     Reset Bbmods and Antenna Online Monitoring Unavailability
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                                     csv_directory=${csv_directory}

    Execute L3 Call In Background                           direction=DL
    ...                                                     duration=${l3_call_duration}s
    ...                                                     throughputs=${throughputs}
    ...                                                     protocol=${protocol}
    ...                                                     called_cell=${cell_dist_names["configuration"]}
    ...                                                     udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}

    ${csv_file_path}                                        Get CSV File
    ${monitored_values_from_csv}                            ant_online_monitoring.get_csv_data
    ...                                                     csv_file_path=${csv_file_path}
    ${monitored_values}                                     ant_online_monitoring.convert_csv_results_to_webui_results_format
    ...                                                     monitored_values_from_csv=${monitored_values_from_csv}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Verifying antenna online monitoring measurements..
    Verify Antenna Online Monitoring Measurements Presence
    ...                                                     monitored_values=${monitored_values}
    ...                                                     required_measurements=${required_measurements}
    ...                                                     antenna_list=${antenna_list}
    Verify Antenna Online Monitoring Measurements during L3Call
    ...                                                     monitored_values=${monitored_values}
    ...                                                     cell_dist_name=${cell_dist_names["configuration"]}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     antenna_list=${antenna_list}

    webui.stop_antenna_line_monitoring                      timeout=${timeout}

    vm.move_file_to_target_directory                        origin_file_path=${csv_file_path}
    ...                                                     target_file_path=${csv_directory}/ANTLMonitoring_monitored_values_final_verification

    Wait For Background L3 Call Completion And Verify Results
    ...                                                     called_cell=${cell_dist_names["configuration"]}

    [Teardown]                                              Antenna Online Monitoring Teardown
